    "description": "Each declared secret yields a render template whose destination path is computed from the secret name, an optional per-secret file override, and an optional secret-volume-path. A bare secret renders to '<volume>/<name>'. A relative file override nests under the volume; an absolute file override is appended to the volume path. Overriding the global secret-volume-path relocates the destination accordingly."
